WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.245
A library can be a quiet place to explore. You do not need to hurry.

2
00:00:04.245 --> 00:00:08.989
Go inside and take a moment to look around. You can sit down if you need to.

3
00:00:08.989 --> 00:00:13.546
Ask the desk how to join or where to find a book. Showing a note is fine.

4
00:00:13.546 --> 00:00:18.353
Choose a book or a comfortable place to sit. You can stay for a little while.

5
00:00:18.353 --> 00:00:22.348
If you borrow a book, ask when it is due and where to return it.

6
00:00:22.348 --> 00:00:25.907
Keep the book safe in your bag. Leave when you are ready.

7
00:00:25.907 --> 00:00:32.900
Different libraries have different routines. Asking staff for directions is always okay.
